design\releases\0_0_3\F_86_codex_conversation_activity_frontend.md:23:Live action state in `ActionExecutionService` holds user messages plus one assistant text buffer. It cannot carry item lifecycle updates. `StatusBar` contains project counts, sync, persisted token usage, remote status, keyboard state, and running agents. No service or component consumes Codex account limits.
